==Luxembourgish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|lb|gem-pro||*hwanǭ}}, accusative of {{inh|lb|gem-pro|*hwaz}}. Compare {{cog|de|wen}} (accusative of {{m|de|wer}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/viə̯n/|lang=lb}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|lb|pronoun}}

# {{lb|lb|interrogative}} [[who]], [[whom]]
# {{lb|lb|relative}} [[who]], [[whoever]], [[whom]]

====Usage notes====
* ''wien'' is the nominative and accusative form. In the dative case, use {{m|lb|wiem}}.
* Due to the Eifeler Regel, the final ''-n'' is lost before all consonants other than <d>, <h>, <n>, <t> and <z>.